text = "[color=#000][font_size=25]
Welcome to the ultimate parkour challenge! Test your movement skills across 5 unique levels designed to push your speed and precision to the limit. There are no limited lives here, you can respawn as many times as you need, and failing will only send you back to the start of your current level rather than forcing you to restart the whole game. Your ultimate goal is speed: a global timer tracks your progress across every single levels, challenging you to find the fastest lines, nail your jumps, and cross the final portal with the lowest time possible."

